<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia October gross wages rose 21.1 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia October gross wages rose 21.1 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Monday.</p>
<p>    AVERAGE GROSS WAGES	    Oct	 Sept     Oct 95</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	   2.8	 0.5	 2.7</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)	    21.1	17.8	21.7 --</p>
<p>Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
